# Prisma Conventions

- Models: PascalCase. Fields: camelCase
- Every model must have: id (cuid), createdAt, updatedAt
- Use @default(cuid()) for primary keys
- Always use the singleton client from src/lib/db.ts (factory: src/lib/create-prisma-client.ts)
- Client is generated to src/generated/prisma — run `npm run db:generate` after schema changes
- CLI config: root prisma.config.ts (datasource URL, migrations, seed)
- After schema changes: run `npm run db:migrate` to create a migration
- Migration names: descriptive snake_case (e.g., add_user_email_index)
- SSL enforced for all PostgreSQL connections
- Use Prisma's `$transaction` for multi-step operations
